{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43615","headline":"报恩寺南池联句 · 陆龟蒙","name":"报恩寺南池联句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"古岸涵碧落，虚轩明素波。\n坐来鱼阵变，吟久菊□多。\n秋草分杉露，危桥下竹坡。\n远峰青髻竝，□□□髯和。\n赵论寒仍讲，支硎僻亦过。\n斋心曾养鹤，挥翰好邀鹅。\n倚石收奇药，临溪藉浅莎。\n桂花晴似拭，荷镜晓如磨。\n翠出牛头耸，苔深马迹跛。\n繖欹从野醉，巾侧任田歌。\n跁跒松形矮，般跚桧樾矬。\n香飞僧印火，泉急使镳珂。\n菱钿真堪帖，蓴丝亦好拖。\n几时无一事，相伴着烟萝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43615.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43615","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}